  "rationale": "The chart contains explicit, active documentation of heart failure with reduced ejection fraction (EF 32%) and an elevated BNP (880), confirming chronic systolic heart failure. The assessment states 'heart failure with reduced ejection fraction and it is active,' and no negation, family history, screening, hypothetical, or resolved language appears in the mention windows. The guideline directs assignment of an I50 code to specify the type of heart failure, supporting I50.22 for chronic systolic heart failure.",
